## .NET
bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.vscode/

## Publish output
publish/

## Dotquay's own runtime state. Deliberately NOT "/.dotquay/": since v0.6 patches live at
## .dotquay/patches/ and must be committed, and git won't descend into an ignored directory to
## un-ignore anything inside it. dotquay writes .dotquay/.gitignore to draw the line itself.
/.dotquay/cache/
/.dotquay/staging/

## Godot's per-machine import cache for the plugin dev project (src/Dotquay.Godot).
## Regenerated by `godot --headless --import`, which run_tests.ps1 does automatically.
.godot/
*.translation
